    "body": "Having surpassed the 70% translated point, I'd be happy to officially add German translations to the README and website.\r\n\r\nBefore we can proceed, I'll need the following JS object translated if you've got the time 😊\r\nhttps://github.com/starship/starship/blob/master/docs/.vuepress/config.js#L45-L63",
